(7527717, 1203246, 185773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing image! Fabulously sharp where it should be. I certainly wouldn''t want to meet this creature on a dark night (or even by day ;-)<br/>Many congrats on your HM, Roger. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi IreneM, Please do not be alarm, this is just a beetle and it is just almost 2 inches in length, they have very beautiful compound eyes and they are tree dweller. We commonly find them resting on leafs and at time on small branches. Thank you very much for your kind feedback.<br/> <br/>Best regards,<br/> <br/>Roger New</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: Amazing image! Fabulously sharp where it should be. I certainly wouldn''t want to meet this creature on a dark night (or even by day ;-)Many congrats on your HM, Roger.   Hi IreneM, Please do not be alarm, this is just a beetle and it is just almost 2 inches in length, they have very beautiful compound eyes and they are tree dweller. We commonly find them resting on leafs and at time on small branches. Thank you very much for your kind feedback. Best regards, Roger New', '2017-08-08 08:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
